  "statement_html": "<div class=\"wims_instruction\"><ul class=\"wims_nopuce\"><li><img style=\"float:left;width:20px;height:20px;\" src=\"/api/static/gifs/calculator_not.svg\" alt=\"Calculatrices interdites\" ><strong>La calculatrice n'est pas autorisée, ni le brouillon.</strong></li>\t<li><u>Aide à la saisie : </u>saisir 1.25 pour 1,25, saisir 3/4 pour \\(\\frac{3}{4}\\), saisir 2^3 pour \\(2^{3}\\) et saisir sqrt(3) pour \\(\\sqrt{ 3}\\).</li></ul></div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply1\">Question 1:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  \\(6 \\times 7= {}\\)\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply1\" data-size=\"10\"></span> </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply2\">Question 2:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  Écris en chiffre le nombre <b>huit-mille-vingt-six</b>\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply2\" data-size=\"10\"></span> </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply3\">Question 3:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  \\(57 - 28 =\\)\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply3\" data-size=\"10\"></span> </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply4\">Question 4:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  \\(4 \\times 3 \\times 25 \\times 3=\\)\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply4\" data-size=\"10\"></span> </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply5\">Question 5:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  \\(27.09 + 16.7 =\\)\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply5\" data-size=\"10\"></span> </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply6\">Question 6:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  Écriture décimale de : \\(28+\\frac{7}{100}+\\frac{4}{1000}=\\)\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply6\" data-size=\"10\"></span> </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply7\">Question 7:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  \\(53-9 \\times 2=\\)\t   <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply7\" data-size=\"10\"></span> </div>\t   <h2><label for=\"reply8\">Question 8:</label></h2>\t  <div class=\"wims_question\">\t  Complète : \\(3.1 k m =\